/// Whether an account belongs to the whole organization or to one branch.
///
/// Every account seeded today is ORGANIZATION, and that is deliberate rather
/// than provisional: which branch a posting belongs to is carried by
/// `AccountDimension.branchId` on each line and by `JournalEntry.branchId`,
/// not by owning a separate account per branch. Duplicating the chart per
/// branch would make a consolidated trial balance a join rather than a sum.
///
/// BRANCH exists so the chart can express a genuinely branch-owned account
/// later. No posting path selects on it yet.
